<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
   "Settings" — three sliders. A gear is the more conventional glyph but is
   fiddly to hand-draw legibly at 24dp, and sliders match what the Settings
   screen actually is: toggles and choice lists. Each track breaks around its
   knob so the knob reads as a control rather than a lump on the line, and the
   knobs sit at three different positions so it can't be mistaken for a sort
   or list icon.
-->
